  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Music. Enter divers Friends at several doors."
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "The good time of day to you, sir.",
          "plainText": "The good time of day to you sir",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I also wish it to you. I think this honourable lord did but try us this other day.",
          "plainText": "I also wish it to you I think this honourable lord did but try us this other day",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Upon that were my thoughts tiring when we encountered. I hope it is not so low with him as he made it seem in the trial of his several friends.",
          "plainText": "Upon that were my thoughts tiring when we encountered I hope it is not so low with him as he made it seem in the trial of his several friends",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "It should not be, by the persuasion of his new feasting.",
          "plainText": "It should not be by the persuasion of his new feasting",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I should think so. He hath sent me an earnest inviting, which many my near occasions did urge me to put off; but he hath conjured me beyond them, and I must needs appear.",
          "plainText": "I should think so He hath sent me an earnest inviting which many my near occasions did urge me to put off but he hath conjured me beyond them and I must needs appear",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "In like manner was I in debt to my importunate business, but he would not hear my excuse. I am sorry, when he sent to borrow of me, that my provision was out.",
          "plainText": "In like manner was I in debt to my importunate business but he would not hear my excuse I am sorry when he sent to borrow of me that my provision was out",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I am sick of that grief too, as I understand how all things go.",
          "plainText": "I am sick of that grief too as I understand how all things go",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Every man here's so. What would he have borrowed you?",
          "plainText": "Every man here's so What would he have borrowed you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "A thousand pieces.",
          "plainText": "A thousand pieces",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "A thousand pieces!",
          "plainText": "A thousand pieces",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What of you?",
          "plainText": "What of you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He sent to me, sir—here he comes.",
          "plainText": "He sent to me sirhere he comes",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Timon and Attendants."
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "With all my heart, gentlemen both! And how fare you?",
          "plainText": "With all my heart gentlemen both And how fare you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ever at the best, hearing well of your lordship.",
          "plainText": "Ever at the best hearing well of your lordship",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "The swallow follows not summer more willing than we your lordship.",
          "plainText": "The swallow follows not summer more willing than we your lordship",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "[Aside.] Nor more willingly leaves winter, such summer birds are men. Gentlemen, our dinner will not recompense this long stay. Feast your ears with the music awhile, if they will fare so harshly o' th' trumpet's sound; we shall to't presently.",
          "plainText": "Aside Nor more willingly leaves winter such summer birds are men Gentlemen our dinner will not recompense this long stay Feast your ears with the music awhile if they will fare so harshly o' th' trumpet's sound we shall to't presently",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I hope it remains not unkindly with your lordship that I returned you an empty messenger.",
          "plainText": "I hope it remains not unkindly with your lordship that I returned you an empty messenger",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-018",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O, sir, let it not trouble you.",
          "plainText": "O sir let it not trouble you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-019",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "My noble lord—",
          "plainText": "My noble lord",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-020",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Ah, my good friend, what cheer?",
          "plainText": "Ah my good friend what cheer",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-021",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "My most honourable lord, I am e'en sick of shame that when your lordship this other day sent to me I was so unfortunate a beggar.",
          "plainText": "My most honourable lord I am e'en sick of shame that when your lordship this other day sent to me I was so unfortunate a beggar",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-022",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Think not on't, sir.",
          "plainText": "Think not on't sir",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-023",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "If you had sent but two hours before—",
          "plainText": "If you had sent but two hours before",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-024",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Let it not cumber your better remembrance.",
          "plainText": "Let it not cumber your better remembrance",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[The banquet brought in.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-025",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "All covered dishes!",
          "plainText": "All covered dishes",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-026",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Royal cheer, I warrant you.",
          "plainText": "Royal cheer I warrant you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-027",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Doubt not that, if money and the season can yield it.",
          "plainText": "Doubt not that if money and the season can yield it",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-028",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How do you? What's the news?",
          "plainText": "How do you What's the news",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-029",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Alcibiades is banished. Hear you of it?",
          "plainText": "Alcibiades is banished Hear you of it",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-030",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-and-second-friends",
        "name": "FIRST AND SECOND FRIENDS",
        "displayName": "First And Second Friends"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Alcibiades banished?",
          "plainText": "Alcibiades banished",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-031",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "'Tis so, be sure of it.",
          "plainText": "'Tis so be sure of it",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-032",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How, how?",
          "plainText": "How how",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-033",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I pray you, upon what?",
          "plainText": "I pray you upon what",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-034",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "My worthy friends, will you draw near?",
          "plainText": "My worthy friends will you draw near",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-035",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I'll tell you more anon. Here's a noble feast toward.",
          "plainText": "I'll tell you more anon Here's a noble feast toward",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-036",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "This is the old man still.",
          "plainText": "This is the old man still",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-037",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Will't hold, will't hold?",
          "plainText": "Will't hold will't hold",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-038",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "It does, but time will—and so—",
          "plainText": "It does but time willand so",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-039",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I do conceive.",
          "plainText": "I do conceive",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-040",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Each man to his stool with that spur as he would to the lip of his mistress. Your diet shall be in all places alike. Make not a city feast of it, to let the meat cool ere we can agree upon the first place. Sit, sit. The gods require our thanks:",
          "plainText": "Each man to his stool with that spur as he would to the lip of his mistress Your diet shall be in all places alike Make not a city feast of it to let the meat cool ere we can agree upon the first place Sit sit The gods require our thanks",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "long average line length"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "You great benefactors, sprinkle our society with thankfulness. For your own gifts make yourselves praised, but reserve still to give, lest your deities be despised. Lend to each man enough, that one need not lend to another; for, were your godheads to borrow of men, men would forsake the gods. Make the meat be beloved more than the man that gives it. Let no assembly of twenty be without a score of villains. If there sit twelve women at the table, let a dozen of them be as they are. The rest of your foes, O gods, the senators of Athens, together with the common lag of people, what is amiss in them, you gods, make suitable for destruction. For these my present friends, as they are to me nothing, so in nothing bless them, and to nothing are they welcome.",
          "plainText": "You great benefactors sprinkle our society with thankfulness For your own gifts make yourselves praised but reserve still to give lest your deities be despised Lend to each man enough that one need not lend to another for were your godheads to borrow of men men would forsake the gods Make the meat be beloved more than the man that gives it Let no assembly of twenty be without a score of villains If there sit twelve women at the table let a dozen of them be as they are The rest of your foes O gods the senators of Athens together with the common lag of people what is amiss in them you gods make suitable for destruction For these my present friends as they are to me nothing so in nothing bless them and to nothing are they welcome",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "long average line length"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Uncover, dogs, and lap.",
          "plainText": "Uncover dogs and lap",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "long average line length"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-004",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[The dishes are uncovered and prove to be full of lukewarm water.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-041",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "some-speak",
        "name": "SOME SPEAK",
        "displayName": "Some Speak"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "What does his lordship mean?",
          "plainText": "What does his lordship mean",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-042",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "some-other",
        "name": "SOME OTHER",
        "displayName": "Some Other"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I know not.",
          "plainText": "I know not",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-043",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "timon",
        "name": "TIMON",
        "displayName": "Timon"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "May you a better feast never behold,",
          "plainText": "May you a better feast never behold",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "You knot of mouth-friends! Smoke and lukewarm water",
          "plainText": "You knot of mouthfriends Smoke and lukewarm water",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Is your perfection. This is Timon's last,",
          "plainText": "Is your perfection This is Timon's last",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Who, stuck and spangled with your flatteries,",
          "plainText": "Who stuck and spangled with your flatteries",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Washes it off and sprinkles in your faces",
          "plainText": "Washes it off and sprinkles in your faces",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Your reeking villainy.",
          "plainText": "Your reeking villainy",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-005",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Throws water in their faces.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-006",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[He attacks them and forces them out.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-007",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-008",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Timon's Friends, the Senators with other Lords."
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-044",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How now, my lords?",
          "plainText": "How now my lords",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-045",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Know you the quality of Lord Timon's fury?",
          "plainText": "Know you the quality of Lord Timon's fury",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-046",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Push! Did you see my cap?",
          "plainText": "Push Did you see my cap",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-047",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "fourth-friend",
        "name": "FOURTH FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Fourth Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I have lost my gown.",
          "plainText": "I have lost my gown",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-048",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He's but a mad lord, and nought but humours sways him. He gave me a jewel th' other day, and now he has beat it out of my hat. Did you see my jewel?",
          "plainText": "He's but a mad lord and nought but humours sways him He gave me a jewel th' other day and now he has beat it out of my hat Did you see my jewel",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-049",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Did you see my cap?",
          "plainText": "Did you see my cap",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-050",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0057",
          "number": 57,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Here 'tis.",
          "plainText": "Here 'tis",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-051",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "fourth-friend",
        "name": "FOURTH FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Fourth Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0058",
          "number": 58,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Here lies my gown.",
          "plainText": "Here lies my gown",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-052",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-friend",
        "name": "FIRST FRIEND",
        "displayName": "First Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0059",
          "number": 59,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Let's make no stay.",
          "plainText": "Let's make no stay",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-053",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "second-friend",
        "name": "SECOND FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Second Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0060",
          "number": 60,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Lord Timon's mad.",
          "plainText": "Lord Timon's mad",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-054",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "third-friend",
        "name": "THIRD FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Third Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0061",
          "number": 61,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I feel't upon my bones.",
          "plainText": "I feel't upon my bones",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-speech-055",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "fourth-friend",
        "name": "FOURTH FRIEND",
        "displayName": "Fourth Friend"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-line-0062",
          "number": 62,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "One day he gives us diamonds, next day stones.",
          "plainText": "One day he gives us diamonds next day stones",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timon-of-athens-3-6-stage-009",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}